{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@3267","endTime":341483.205,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 18\nBeen There.\n\nA services marketplace website with skill search, freelancer discovery, and distinct client and freelancer pathways.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nServices marketplace\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nConnect a job with the person to do it.\n\nBeen There’s web artwork introduces a marketplace for physical jobs. Its opening view combines a skill-search field with a clear product proposition. Navigation distinguishes client and freelancer audiences, while supporting sections introduce the service and the people available through it.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Been There's original project material.\n\n01\nSkill search\n\nThe opening screen includes a search field for exploring skills or jobs.\n\n02\nFreelancer discovery\n\nThe website presents people as the center of the marketplace.\n\n03\nAudience pathways\n\nNavigation distinguishes client and freelancer information.\n\n04\nHow-it-works content\n\nA dedicated informational route supports first-time visitors.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nServices marketplace\n\nDeep green anchors a light, image-led website. The search action receives a clear position in the hero, while portrait photography connects the marketplace concept to people. Generous spacing gives the interface an approachable service-oriented character.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Been There.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nBeen There's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nBeen There / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nLead Management\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nLEAD CAPTURE & FORMS\nLead Management\nSOCIAL & COMMUNITY\nLivSocial\nDIGITAL ASSETS & DISCOVERY\nStreamDataX\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
